  data: {
    LLM: 'Players take turns buying tiles from the banker, keeping a running total. Beyond the first two tiles, one tile is turned face-up so each player has two face-down and the rest face-up. Stick to stop; bust if over 21. Banker then draws without exceeding 21; banker bust pays all remaining players; otherwise banker collects from lower or equal totals and pays higher.',
    Player: 'Players take turns buying tiles from the banker, keeping a running total. Beyond the first two tiles, one tile is turned face-up so each player has two face-down and the rest face-up. Stick to stop; bust if over 21. Banker then draws without exceeding 21; banker bust pays all remaining players; otherwise banker collects from lower or equal totals and pays higher.',
    objective: 'Reach a total of 20 or 21 (or as close as possible without busting) to beat the banker. Stick to stop; bust if over 21 and lose the wager.',
    gameplay: 'Players take turns buying tiles from the banker, keeping a running total. Beyond the first two tiles, one tile is turned face-up so each player has two face-down and the rest face-up. Stick to stop; bust if over 21. Banker then draws without exceeding 21; banker bust pays all remaining players; otherwise banker collects from lower or equal totals and pays higher.',
    keyRules: [
      'Aim for 20 or 21; bust over 21',
      'Max nine tiles per hand',
      'Blank = 0 or 7',
      'Banker draws last; settles with each player',
